<title>USA: TPC hires Lehman to advise on alternatives.</title>
<headline>TPC hires Lehman to advise on alternatives.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>TPC Corp said on Tuesday it had retained Lehman Brothers Inc to help the company explore strategic alternatives, including the possible sale or merger of part or all of the company.</p>
<p>TPC is involved in processing, marketing and storage of natural gas</p>
<p>The analysis is expected to be completed no earlier than the first quarter of 1997, the company said.</p>
</text>
